        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "This work presents a gallery of human skins displayed in frames. The skins are pinned like animal hides. Each frame features a button and an embedded speaker. When the button is pressed, the scar's owner tells the story of how they received the scar and their relationship with the scar itself."
