      "title": "DECAY",
      "content": [
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "DECAY"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Decay was a part of the show Nothing Island shown at Flux Factory on Governors Island in October 2023."
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Decay consisted of a 3D PLA model of Castle Williams that sat on a constantly shaking platform. If the button was held, the shaking would stop. Participants could hold the button or try to re-assemble the model."
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "The work functioned as a commentary on the human urge to prevent decay even when it’s inevitable."
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "2023"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Wood, PLA, Magnets, DC motor."
