          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Fourth Eye is a work created for the AI creative coding platform Aippy. It used the devices camera and the Media Pipe API to track the state of blinking from the user. The program responds with an animated effect that changes based on different types of blinking and eye movement creating an intimate interactive art experience."
